00:01:57.317 --> 00:01:58.584
-Yeah.

00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:00.452
-And I just -- I open my
computer and I sit there --

00:02:00.452 --> 00:02:01.587
But here's the thing.

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:03.990
I have to wait until
everybody is asleep.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.024
That's the way
