00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:06.292
I put the babies down to sleep.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:07.826
Everyone goes to sleep --
Lauren, everybody.

00:02:07.826 --> 00:02:09.528
So at like midnight --

00:02:09.528 --> 00:02:10.729
-That's when you have
your cheat meal?

00:02:10.729 --> 00:02:12.065
-That's when I -- Yes.

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:14.701
And I'm like a troll,
like, "Oh, yeah!"

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:19.072
Open it up and all by myself.
-Yeah.

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:22.942
You just got back from Hawaii.
-I did, yes.

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:24.377
-And you wanted to go there

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:26.679
because you wanted to
stop by the protest over there.

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:27.980
What was going on?

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:31.017
-Sure. So, what's happening
in Hawaii right now is --

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:36.422
there are protesters on the
big island, in Hilo,

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:39.525
and there's a mountain,
Mauna Kea.

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:41.828
And Mauna Kea --
Some of you guys may know this.

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:43.363
Mauna Kea is a sacred place.

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:46.031
It's a sacred place to
native Hawaiians.

00:02:46.031 --> 00:02:48.501
And there's a telescope that's
being propositioned

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.936
to be built there that's
18 stories.

00:02:50.936 --> 00:02:53.539
Eventually, it would be
the size of a football stadium.

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:57.476
And the issue that the native
Hawaiians have is that

00:02:57.476 --> 00:02:58.811
It's sacred land.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:02.582
There was some trust that was
breached between them

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:04.216
and the state and the people
who are trying to

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:05.918
build the telescope.

00:03:05.918 --> 00:03:09.255
And what I wanted to do was
get my boots on the ground,

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:12.425
go there personally, and --
Because I grew up in Hawaii

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:16.896
and I understand what it's like
to have that sacred land.

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:20.399
And when I was -- It was really
a beautiful experience.

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:22.768
It was so inspiring,
because you have

00:03:22.768 --> 00:03:25.171
men and women and children
and elderly --

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:28.641
Kupuna that we call them --
who aren't leaving,

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:32.445
and they are so steadfast and
passionate about this land,

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:33.913
about the sacredness
of the land.

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:37.516
So, I joke that cheat meals were
church, but the truth is --

00:03:37.516 --> 00:03:39.385
this mountain is their church,

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:42.221
and it would be like
building on their church.

00:03:42.221 --> 00:03:45.291
So I wanted to go, get my boots
on the ground there,

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:47.827
and speak to them directly,
get a deeper dialogue with them.

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:49.095
And then I realized something,

00:03:49.095 --> 00:03:54.233
that this is so much bigger than
a telescope being built.

00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:55.768
This is humanity.

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:57.670
These are human beings
whose hearts are hurting.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.306
And I think anytime situations
like that come up,

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:02.975
whether it's -- And, again,
this is like a microcosm

00:04:02.975 --> 00:04:05.344
of the bigger thing
all around the world --

00:04:05.344 --> 00:04:06.746
or at least how I look at it.

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:08.447
When scenarios like this pop up,

00:04:08.447 --> 00:04:10.149
when you have human beings
who are hurting,

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:11.617
any culture around the world,

00:04:11.617 --> 00:04:14.087
that's our indication
that we've got to stop.

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:17.223
Let's be considerate,
let's be empathetic,

00:04:17.223 --> 00:04:19.792
and let's always
take care of our people,

00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:21.594
'cause, at the end of the day,

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:24.063
it always comes down to that,
taking care of the people.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:27.433
-Yeah. Take care of each other.
Good for you for doing that.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:28.735
I'm glad you did that.
-Thank you, Jimmy.

